WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.027
You <b>must</b> do your homework tonight.

00:00:05.164 --> 00:00:08.310
She <b>must</b> tidy her room before she goes out.

00:00:10.512 --> 00:00:12.467
You <b>mustn’t</b> leave your bags here.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.841
I <b>mustn’t</b> forget to call her tonight.

00:00:18.996 --> 00:00:21.098
<b>Must</b> I go to bed now?

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.192
When <b>must</b> we decide about the party?